{"title":"1997 AJHSME Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:50%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME\" title=\"1997 AJHSME\">1997 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)<br />Printable versions: <span class=\"noprint plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems&amp;printable=yes\">Wiki</a></span> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/contest/collection/c3413_amc_8/1997\">AoPS Resources</a> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/contest/download/c3413_amc_8/1997\">PDF</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-size:80%;\">\n<p><font style=\"text-align:center;\">Instructions</font>\n</p>\n<ol><li>This is a 25-question, multiple choice test. Each question is followed by answers marked A, B, C, D and E. Only one of these is correct.</li>\n<li>You will receive&#160;? points for each correct answer,&#160;? points for each problem left unanswered, and&#160;? points for each incorrect answer.</li>\n<li>No aids are permitted other than scratch paper, graph paper, ruler, compass, protractor and erasers.</li>\n<li>Figures are not necessarily drawn to scale.</li>\n<li>You will have <b>? minutes</b> working time to complete the test.</li></ol>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.ph